From c36add8ad45525a4fccf27bf33169ee3f8de0e5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Aldreda <ca@modelmiser.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:13:38 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] cyw43: diagnostics for exploring the firmware's host
 interface

Adds a small diag module: the status of the last command reply, counts and
first bytes of frames received on the data channel, and a census of every
event the firmware sends, taken before the driver filters events. Control
gains diag_get_iovar, diag_set_iovar, diag_enable_all_events,
diag_set_allmulti, diag_monitor and diag_promisc.

Exploration aid, not proposed for upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
